{
    "title": "Cleanfox - Mail & Spam Cleaner",
    "description": "\ud83e\udd47**\u201cWith Cleanfox, you can clean your inbox and the environment. What more could you ask for?\u201d** - Androidpit  \r\n\ud83e\udd47**\u201cCleanfox is a free app, which allows you to unsubscribe from all unwanted email subscriptions easily.\u201d** - Robingood  \r\n\ud83e\udd47**\"Cleanfox is an app that helps users unsubscribe from newsletters, and has so far \u201ccleaned\u201d over 30 million emails\"** - Tech.eu  \r\n\r\nWith Cleanfox, cleaning out all the emails you don't want in your mailbox any more has never been so easy! Cleanfox is a free anti-spam tool to get rid of newsletters/spam/advertising emails with just one click. Cleanfox works with all emails providers (gmail, outlook, yahoo mail, hotmail ...), mails accounts and email apps.   \r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd8a**Cleanfox unsubscribes you from all the emails you don't want to receive any more and enables you to delete your old emails with one click**\ud83e\udd8a Cleanfox allows you to display your newsletters based on your rate of opening them and the number of emails received. Then you can: \u2022 Unsubscribe; or \u2022 Keep your subscription and the old emails; or \u2022 Stay subscribed and delete the old emails.  Cleanfox is available free of charge for Gmail, Outlook, Yahoo Mail, hotmail and all other email services.. \r\n \r\n\ud83c\udf32**How do I plant a tree with Cleanfox?**\ud83c\udf32 \r\nCleanfox has decided to reward its most loyal users by helping them commit to reforestation. For every new customer you introduce to Cleanfox, you can plant a tree in Zambia!  \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc1d**How is Cleanfox good for the environment?** \ud83c\udf38 \r\nOne email generates an emission of 10g of CO2 per year and 200 million emails are sent every minute \u21d2 2,000 tons of CO2 are emitted every minute from emails!  Cleaning up your inbox is an easy way to reduce your carbon footprint and be more productive. \r\n\r\n \ud83d\udcc8**How does Cleanfox make its money?** \ud83d\udcc1 \r\nAt Cleanfox, we believe that transparency is essential to establish a relationship of trust with our users. We are a 100% free service, published by Foxintelligence, which specialises in e-commerce market research. We design our products to respect the privacy of our users. \r\n\r\nMore information on our dedicated page: https://cleanfox.io/en/fox/my-data/ \r\n  \r\nDownload Cleanfox now to better manage your emails, spam and newsletters on Hotmail, Outlook, Gmail, Yahoo mail and all other providers!   \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udce9 support@cleanfox.io \r\n\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Website: www.cleanfox.io",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83e\udd47**\u201cWith Cleanfox, you can clean your inbox and the environment. What more could you ask for?\u201d** - Androidpit  <br>\ud83e\udd47**\u201cCleanfox is a free app, which allows you to unsubscribe from all unwanted email subscriptions easily.\u201d** - Robingood  <br>\ud83e\udd47**&quot;Cleanfox is an app that helps users unsubscribe from newsletters, and has so far \u201ccleaned\u201d over 30 million emails&quot;** - Tech.eu  <br><br>With Cleanfox, cleaning out all the emails you don&#39;t want in your mailbox any more has never been so easy! Cleanfox is a free anti-spam tool to get rid of newsletters/spam/advertising emails with just one click. Cleanfox works with all emails providers (gmail, outlook, yahoo mail, hotmail ...), mails accounts and email apps.   <br><br>\ud83e\udd8a**Cleanfox unsubscribes you from all the emails you don&#39;t want to receive any more and enables you to delete your old emails with one click**\ud83e\udd8a Cleanfox allows you to display your newsletters based on your rate of opening them and the number of emails received. Then you can: \u2022 Unsubscribe; or \u2022 Keep your subscription and the old emails; or \u2022 Stay subscribed and delete the old emails.  Cleanfox is available free of charge for Gmail, Outlook, Yahoo Mail, hotmail and all other email services.. <br> <br>\ud83c\udf32**How do I plant a tree with Cleanfox?**\ud83c\udf32 <br>Cleanfox has decided to reward its most loyal users by helping them commit to reforestation. For every new customer you introduce to Cleanfox, you can plant a tree in Zambia!  <br><br>\ud83d\udc1d**How is Cleanfox good for the environment?** \ud83c\udf38 <br>One email generates an emission of 10g of CO2 per year and 200 million emails are sent every minute \u21d2 2,000 tons of CO2 are emitted every minute from emails!  Cleaning up your inbox is an easy way to reduce your carbon footprint and be more productive. <br><br> \ud83d\udcc8**How does Cleanfox make its money?** \ud83d\udcc1 <br>At Cleanfox, we believe that transparency is essential to establish a relationship of trust with our users. We are a 100% free service, published by Foxintelligence, which specialises in e-commerce market research. We design our products to respect the privacy of our users. <br><br>More information on our dedicated page: https://cleanfox.io/en/fox/my-data/ <br>  <br>Download Cleanfox now to better manage your emails, spam and newsletters on Hotmail, Outlook, Gmail, Yahoo mail and all other providers!   <br><br>\ud83d\udce9 support@cleanfox.io <br>\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Website: www.cleanfox.io",
